WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.320
College is meant to be a place where we are
prepared for the rest of our lives, where we

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:10.900
are formed and we are shaped in order to
act as good human beings with an idea of

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:13.800
the true and the good, and the beautiful

